{"verse_key": "13:18", "surah": 13, "verse": 18, "text_uthmani": "لِلَّذِينَ ٱسْتَجَابُوا۟ لِرَبِّهِمُ ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۚ وَٱلَّذِينَ لَمْ يَسْتَجِيبُوا۟ لَهُۥ لَوْ أَنَّ لَهُم مَّا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ جَمِيعًا وَمِثْلَهُۥ مَعَهُۥ لَٱفْتَدَوْا۟ بِهِۦٓ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ سُوٓءُ ٱلْحِسَابِ وَمَأْوَىٰهُمْ جَهَنَّمُ ۖ وَبِئْسَ ٱلْمِهَادُ", "translation": "For those who have responded to their Lord is the best [reward], but those who did not respond to Him - if they had all that is in the earth entirely and the like of it with it, they would [attempt to] ransom themselves thereby. Those will have the worst account, and their refuge is Hell, and wretched is the resting place.", "verse_from_ms": 483430, "verse_to_ms": 514700, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "لِلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 483430, "end_ms": 484770}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱسْتَجَابُوا۟", "start_ms": 484770, "end_ms": 486090}, {"i": 2, "text": "لِرَبِّهِمُ", "start_ms": 486090, "end_ms": 487230}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ", "start_ms": 487230, "end_ms": 488450}, {"i": 4, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 488450, "end_ms": 490180}, {"i": 5, "text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 490180, "end_ms": 490560}, {"i": 6, "text": "لَمْ", "start_ms": 490560, "end_ms": 491930}, {"i": 7, "text": "يَسْتَجِيبُوا۟", "start_ms": 491930, "end_ms": 492550}, {"i": 8, "text": "لَهُۥ", "start_ms": 492550, "end_ms": 492940}, {"i": 9, "text": "لَوْ", "start_ms": 492940, "end_ms": 494060}, {"i": 10, "text": "أَنَّ", "start_ms": 494060, "end_ms": 494610}, {"i": 11, "text": "لَهُم", "start_ms": 494610, "end_ms": 495370}, {"i": 12, "text": "مَّا", "start_ms": 495370, "end_ms": 495670}, {"i": 13, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 495670, "end_ms": 496440}, {"i": 14, "text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 496440, "end_ms": 497730}, {"i": 15, "text": "جَمِيعًا", "start_ms": 497730, "end_ms": 498860}, {"i": 16, "text": "وَمِثْلَهُۥ", "start_ms": 498860, "end_ms": 499680}, {"i": 17, "text": "مَعَهُۥ